# Jira MCP Workflow

## Authentication

All Jira REST API calls use `$JIRA_EMAIL` and `$JIRA_TOKEN` environment variables.

- `$JIRA_EMAIL` — your Atlassian account email (e.g. `you@example.com`)
- `$JIRA_TOKEN` — your raw Atlassian API token (starts with `ATATT...`)
- `$JIRA_API_URL` — full base URL

**Correct curl pattern:**

```bash
curl -s "$JIRA_API_URL..." \
  -u "$JIRA_EMAIL:$JIRA_TOKEN" \
  -H "Accept: application/json"
```

